  "description": "MCP server for ZStudio EIS (electrochemical impedance spectroscopy). Ties ZStudio's validation / DRT / fitting engine into a conversational analysis flow — check data quality faster, compare physically plausible candidate models, and understand the limits of every result; every number is computed by the verified ZStudio engine, with the AI guiding the workflow. Imports raw multi-vendor measurement files (BioLogic, Gamry, Ivium, Scribner, EcoChemie, and more) into ZStudio .zstudy documents, and opens, inspects, and saves studies via session handles — with token-light per-dataset summaries (no raw spectra), for AI assistants over MCP.",
  "iconFile": "icon.png",
  "id": "FieldCure.Mcp.ZStudio",
  "isPrerelease": false,
  "lastEdited": "2026-06-21T09:04:06.383Z",
